    m_BestFit: 0
    m_MinSize: 10
    m_MaxSize: 300
    m_Alignment: 2
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: At the end of the day, you can walk to your bed to sleep and start the next day. You'll be able to see a recap of your day's events, and then a chance to choose your schedule for the next day. The longer you sleep, the more stress you'll be able to sleep off.
--- !u!114 &217
