    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: Once school has ended, there are multiple options for how to spend your time before you go to sleep. You can study using the bookshelf in your room. You'll be able to study any subject, even ones for classes you aren't currently taking! Just make sure to watch your stress levels.
